  "bodyHtml": "<div id=\"service-container\" class=\"container-fluid\">\n<h1 id=\"about-top-title\" class=\"h1-1\">壓力桶選擇工具</h1>\n\t<div id=\"select_tools\" class=\"container\">\n    \t\t<div class=\"service_spacing-2\"></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"st_txt_style1\">\n            \t<p class=\"lang_rtl\" style=\"text-align:justify;\">溢康擁有多年來良好的客戶服務經驗，對於系統尺寸設計具有豐富的經驗。我們結合設計工程師、零售商和技術人員,將依照您的需求,用計算公式和評估技術數據,提供給您最適合的壓力桶尺寸。這個工具不但使複雜變得簡單,且可以讓您快速又準確地找到我們(AQUASKY PLUS)產品系列裡,您最合適的壓力桶尺寸。透過簡單的壓力資料點擊，這個工具可以為您的系統顯示最適合的壓力桶尺寸</p>\n            </div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"service_spacing-2\"></div>\n\n\t\t\t  <div class=\"row\">\n              \t<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n                \t<div class=\"step_style-1\"><p>STEP 1</p></div>\n                </div>\n              <div class=\"col-sm-9\">\n                    <div class=\"step_style-2\">\n                        <div class=\"step_bottom_border\">SELECT UNIT</div>\n                        <div class=\"row\">\n                        \t<div id=\"btn_selectA\" class=\"col-sm-6 select_btn btn_active\">Bar</div>\n                        \t<div id=\"btn_selectB\" class=\"col-sm-6 select_btn\">PSI</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n\t\t\t  <div class=\"step_arrow_down\"><img src=\"/images/arrow_down.jpg\" width=\"78\" height=\"66\"></div>\n\n\t\t\t<div id=\"select_A\">\n\n\t\t\t<form name=\"form1\" method=\"post\" action=\"#\" class=\"form-horizontal\">\n            <input id=\"select_unitA\" name=\"select_unit\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"bar\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n\t<div class=\"col-md-6 px-0\">\n\n\t\t\t  <div class=\"row\">\n              \t<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n                \t<div class=\"step_style-1\"><p>STEP 2</p></div>\n                </div>\n              <div class=\"col-sm-9\">\n                    <div class=\"step_style-2\">\n                        <div class=\"step_bottom_border\">BOOSTER SYSTEM SETTINGS</div>\n\n                          <div class=\"row setp_space_top\">\n                          \t<div class=\"col-sm-4 vc_center\"><p>Water flow</p></div>\n                            <div class=\"col-sm-4\"><input id=\"water_flow\" name=\"water_flow\" type=\"number\" class=\"form-control text-center\" value=\"1\" min=\"1\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"col-sm-4 vc_center\"><p>L/min</p></div>\n                          </div>\n\n                          <div class=\"row setp_space_top\">\n                          \t<div class=\"col-sm-4 vc_center\"><p>Set Pressure</p></div>\n                            \t<div class=\"col-sm-4\"><input id=\"set_pressure\" name=\"set_pressure\" type=\"number\" class=\"form-control text-center\" value=\"2\" min=\"1\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"col-sm-4 vc_center\"><p>Bar</p></div>\n                          </div>\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\t\t\t  <div class=\"step_arrow_down\"><img src=\"/images/arrow_down.jpg\" width=\"78\" height=\"66\"></div>\n\n\t\t\t  <div class=\"row\">\n              \t<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n                \t<div class=\"step_style-1\"><p>STEP 3</p></div>\n                </div>\n              \t<div class=\"col-sm-9\">\n                    <div class=\"step_style-2\">\n                    \t<div class=\"step_bottom_border\">PROPER TANK SIZE</div>\n\n                          <div class=\"row setp_space_top\">\n                          \t<div class=\"col-sm-4\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n                            \t<div id=\"out_proper_tank_size\" class=\"form-control AF_bg text-center step4_txt_1\"></div>\n                                 <input id=\"input_proper_tank_size\" name=\"input_proper_tank_size\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"col-sm-4 step4_txt_2 vc_center\"><p>L, or above</p></div>\n                          </div>\n\n